[{"answer":"Hi Chantal. What did you think of the talk, then?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Hi Hugo.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I thought it was good once I'd moved seats.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, were the people beside you chatting or something?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/4.mp3"},{"answer":"It wasn't that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/5.mp3"},{"answer":"I went early so that I'd get a seat and not have to stand,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/6.mp3"},{"answer":"but then this guy sat right in front of me and he was so tall!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/7.mp3"},{"answer":"It's hard to see through people's heads, isn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Impossible!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Anyway, to answer your question,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/10.mp3"},{"answer":"I thought it was really interesting,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/11.mp3"},{"answer":"especially what the speaker said about the job market.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Me too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/13.mp3"},{"answer":"I mean we know we're going into a really competitive field so it's obvious that we may struggle to get work.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/14.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/15.mp3"},{"answer":"and we know we can't all have that 'dream job'.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, but it looks like there's a whole range of... areas of work that we hadn't even thought of,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/17.mp3"},{"answer":"like fashion journalism, for instance.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, I wasn't expecting so many career options.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Overall, she had quite a strong message, didn't she?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/20.mp3"},{"answer":"She did.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/21.mp3"},{"answer":"She kept saying things like 'I know you all think this, but...'","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/22.mp3"},{"answer":"and then she'd tell us how it really is.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Perhaps she thinks students are a bit narrow-minded about the industry.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/24.mp3"},{"answer":"It was a bit harsh, though!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/25.mp3"},{"answer":"We know it's a tough industry.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, and we're only first-years, after all.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/27.mp3"},{"answer":"We've got a lot to learn.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Exactly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you think our secondary school education should have been more career-focused?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, we had numerous talks on careers, which was good,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/31.mp3"},{"answer":"but none of them were very inspiring.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/32.mp3"},{"answer":"They could've asked more people like today's speaker to talk to us.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/33.mp3"},{"answer":"I agree.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/34.mp3"},{"answer":"We were told about lots of different careers, just when we needed to be,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/35.mp3"},{"answer":"but not by the experts who really know stuff.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/36.mp3"},{"answer":"So did today's talk influence your thoughts on what career you'd like to take up in the future?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Well. I promised myself that I'd go through this course and keep an open mind till the end.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/38.mp3"},{"answer":"But I think it's better to pick an area of the industry now and then aim to get better and better at it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I think we'll just have to differ on that issue!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/40.mp3"},{"answer":"One thing's for certain, though.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/41.mp3"},{"answer":"From what she said, we'll be unpaid assistants in the industry for quite a long time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/42.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm prepared for that, aren't you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Actually, I'm not going to accept that view.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Really?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/45.mp3"},{"answer":"But she knows it's the case,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/46.mp3"},{"answer":"and everyone else says the same.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/47.mp3"},{"answer":"That doesn't mean it has to be true for me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/48.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I hope you're right!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/50.mp3"},{"answer":"I thought the speaker's account of her first job was fascinating.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, she admitted she was lucky to get work being a personal dresser for a musician.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/52.mp3"},{"answer":"She didn't even apply for the job","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/53.mp3"},{"answer":"and there she was getting paid to choose all his clothes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/54.mp3"},{"answer":"It must have felt amazing,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/55.mp3"},{"answer":"though she said all she was looking for back then was experience, not financial reward.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/56.mp3"},{"answer":"And then he was so mean, telling her she was more interested in her own appearance than his!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/57.mp3"},{"answer":"But she did realise he was right about that,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/58.mp3"},{"answer":"which really made me think.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/59.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm always considering my own clothes","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/60.mp3"},{"answer":"but now I can see you should be focusing on your client!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/61.mp3"},{"answer":"She obviously regretted losing the job.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, as she said, she should have hidden her negative feelings about him, but she didn't.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/63.mp3"},{"answer":"It was really brave the way she picked herself up and took that job in retail.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Fancy working in a shop after that!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, well, she recommended we all do it at some point.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/66.mp3"},{"answer":"I guess as a designer you'd get to find out some useful information,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/67.mp3"},{"answer":"like how big or small the average shopper is.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/68.mp3"},{"answer":"I think that's an issue for manufacturers, not designers.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/69.mp3"},{"answer":"However, it would be useful to know if there's a gap in the market, you know,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/70.mp3"},{"answer":"an item that no one's stocking but that consumers are looking for.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, people don't give up searching.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/72.mp3"},{"answer":"They also take things back to the store if they aren't right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Imagine you worked in an expensive shop","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/75.mp3"},{"answer":"and you found out the garments sold there were being returned because they... fell apart in the wash!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/76.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, it would be good to know that kind of thing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-18-test-1-part-3-2023-06-16-20-38-01/77.mp3"}]
